;   $120/$121 accel 1000/1000mm/s^2 (UNVERIFIED default)
;   planner 15 blocks, RX 128 bytes (UNVERIFIED default)
;   controller parse 0.3ms/line (UNVERIFIED default)
;   sender: char_count, 11520 bytes/s, 2.0ms one-way latency (UNVERIFIED default)
;   50 laser-on strokes, 14326mm: 172s at commanded F, 367s predicted (overall energy factor 2.13)
;   total predicted job time 7.0 min
